## sorted_records (exit 1)
error[Z0401]: `list` of `sorted` must be a List<Bool | Int | Float | Str>, but this is a List<{a: Int}>
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:8
  |
1 | sorted([{a: 1}, {a: 2}])
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a List<{a: Int}>
  |
  = help: usage: `sorted(list, desc: Bool = false)`

## sorted_desc_not_bool (exit 1)
error[Z0401]: `desc` of `sorted` must be a Bool, but this is an Int
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:22
  |
1 | sorted([1, 2], desc: 1)
  |                      ^ an Int
  |
  = help: usage: `sorted(list, desc: Bool = false)`

## is_in_not_a_list (exit 1)
